WEBVTT

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.580
The hee-row?

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.790
Yes, he protects the human world.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.460
The hero is powerful beyond words...

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.000
Just to speak of him sends chills down my spine!

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.290
He defeated Chaos Lord Belial,
the mighty Sorcerer Lord Astarot,

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.580
and countless other brave warriors of eld!

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:41.630
Young lady, should you become our Queen,
do not engage the hero in combat.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.250
Fighting him would lead to your destruction!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.630
Oh, please! That's so dumb!

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:54.080
I don't know why you're so afraid of this heerow.
He's just a human!

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.500
If I ever saw him, I'd give him a beat-down!

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.920
Not like I'm ever gonna choose to be Queen, though!

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.540
You told me you want to save
the Demon World, right, Echidna?

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.830
You said you'd endure blood, sweat, and tears...

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.330
to obtain the stone and bring peace to fruition.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.080
Blood, sweat, and tears.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.330
The time to prove your mettle is now!

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.250
If you want the Stone, if you want to save the world,

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.880
then stop me, here and now,

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.460
brave heroes!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:49.830
Ikite ikite ikitsukuse

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:54.290
Hikari o mirai e

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:08.170
Uragirareta kodoku na sekai ni torinokosare

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.710
Miushinatta ashita o osorete ima mo

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.830
Ibasho o sagasu

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:23.330
Hitsuyou to saretai kokoro no sakebi

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:32.130
Karamiau IDENTITY tashikametainda shinjite iikana

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.500
Ikite ikite ikitsukuse

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.500
Hikari o mirai e

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.000
Tatoe subete ushinattemo

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:47.330
Kibou o tsunaide

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.040
Boku ga koko ni iru imi

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:54.920
Ima wa wakaranakute mo ii

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.790
Kimi to waraiaeru you ni

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:04.710
Jibun de tachikitte susumudake

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.580
<b>I'll Save the World, Even If That Means Destroying It</b>

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:33.710
Leo, you fool...

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:46.830
What do you mean by that?

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.250
Are you mad?! Have you lost your mind?!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.000
Queen Echidna!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.420
Nope, my mind's all here.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.420
My job is to keep this world safe.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.670
That's the reason I was made.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.670
The only reason I live for!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.670
A single swing is that powerful?!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:28.380
If I can't save the world, I'll lose my whole identity.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:35.000
If humanity doesn't need me,
then I'll make them need me!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:39.830
I'll save the world, even if I have to destroy it first!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.960
You would decide to switch ends and means!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.420
Why would you destroy
the very thing you want to protect?!

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:50.500
All that would await you is a devastated land!

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:53.170
Devastation! Hell, I'll take it.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:57.580
I've protected this world long enough.
Who cares if I destroy it?!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.040
Leo...?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:09.630
Emptying everything out and starting
from scratch sounds pretty damn good!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:28.330
Lord Leo, enough of this foolishness!

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.420
Calm yourself! This isn't like you!

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:34.960
He's right! Why do we have to fight?!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.960
Have you been paying attention, you moron Generals?!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.580
Obsidian Cage!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.460
A binding spell? Really?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:07.830
If you want my heart, then you're going to have to kill me!

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.330
Don't be ridiculous!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.080
If your heart really is the Philosopher's Stone,

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:17.540
then why not continue to help us,
as you've been doing this whole time?!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.920
You said you wouldn't betray us!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:26.040
Or was that all a lie?

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.920
Were we never friends at all?!

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:35.130
If you don't kill me, then you'll all die.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.210
Edvard!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.040
Edvard...

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.830
Leo, you really mean to kill us...?

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:58.000
I'm sick of it all!

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.580
My hyper-reactive skill improvement,

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.170
my existence as an immortal guardian
for humanity, all of it!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.460
I'm not even allowed to die to end it all!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.920
I just keep protecting, guarding, defending,

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:14.540
and even when they finally say
they don't need me, it doesn't end!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.290
Leo, you bastard...

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.580
Who should I hate, huh?

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.790
The humans who made me?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.420
Or the demons who forced their hand?

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.830
What...?

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.750
All of you, that's who.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.960
So I'll destroy both the human AND the demon worlds...

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.880
and quit all this heroing bullshit once and for all.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:22.460
No... I knew he was holding back when we fought before,

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.000
but is this his true strength?

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:32.210
What now? I can't fight him in this state...

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:38.250
And my mana core hasn't yet fully
recovered from our last battle!

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.880
Is this the time to use that spell?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.420
It would still be a gamble.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.960
And I have no idea if it will work...

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.330
Please stop, Leo!

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:53.040
Lily?!

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.830
Please, don't do this!

00:08:56.710 --> 00:09:00.000
This isn't like you, Leo!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:08.460
Do you remember when we were on Largo,
and you listened when I had problems?

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.380
You told me tons of really good advice, too!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:15.500
Yep, I did. I remember.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:19.670
It's my turn to return the favor!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.790
So tell me all your problems! I'll hear you out!

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:29.000
So please, stop! Let's not fight!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:32.750
All right.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.500
Leo...

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:40.500
My problems? ALL my problems?

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.040
You want to hear what my problems are, Lily?

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:48.250
Yeah, I do! I'll hear you out, no matter what!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.460
Right now, my biggest problem...

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:52.500
Yeah?

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:54.750
My biggest problem...

00:09:56.790 --> 00:10:02.790
...is that the heroes I expected so much
from are so goddamn weak!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:11.750
Lily!

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.630
I get it now.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:25.540
You're no hero... Not anymore.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:33.670
No real hero would ruthlessly attack
a harmless, unarmed opponent!

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:45.210
Fill my hands with the piercing rays of the gods!
Destroy mine enemy!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.420
Gae Assail!

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.670
So you finally got serious.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.170
Not even high-level spells can hurt him?!

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.920
Come, heroes!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:16.670
If you want your world to survive,
then stop me with every last fiber of your being!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.580
Very well!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:24.330
I am grateful to you, Lord Leo!

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:32.750
You taught this ignorant oaf to understand
the weaknesses in those around him!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.250
You were a fine teacher!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.750
Never have I known a man such as you!

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:43.790
You had my utmost respect, from the bottom of my heart!

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:47.250
You were a true ally and a friend!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:50.790
And now you realize you were wrong?
That I was a villain?

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:55.460
No, I still feel that way!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:12:01.420
But even if you are my friend...
No, BECAUSE you are my friend...

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.540
He's unleashed his dragon blood?!
He's getting serious, too!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:08.670
If you have strayed from the path,
it is my duty to cut you down!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.250
Impossible!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.920
Cocytus Ptolomea.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.420
It's not...

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.000
Inferno Gehenna.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.920
He's casting spells with opposing elements
at the same time?!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.170
Edvard!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:33.290
And now your precious dragon scales are all but useless.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.880
Destroyed by a rapid change in temperature.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.630
Know how that works? Probably not, huh.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.170
Begone, Dragon General.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.040
Two down.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.420
This villain...!

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.290
Leo...

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:09.790
Do not discount the Demon Queen's strength!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.500
Behemoth Tail!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:12.830
Earthen Grave!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.920
Good work! Now burn to your death!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:17.920
Inferno!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:39.880
No!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:41.580
Impossible...

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:47.380
After being hit with that many attacks,
he's suffered almost no damage?!

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:55.750
Wait... His special ability is
'hyper-reactive skill improvement', right?

00:13:56.170 --> 00:14:00.080
He copies the abilities of others and
endlessly improves upon them...

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:03.130
Does that apply to defense, too?

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:08.170
If he grows stronger with every foe he faces,

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.460
with every attack that hits him...

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.040
No. This doesn't fare well for us!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.790
If this battle continues...!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.080
I thought you'd be next, boy!

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:34.710
I must be out of practice. Thought that was a sure kill.

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:38.790
That was a perfect strike. He's just a monster.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.500
Good point. And a real pain...

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:43.830
Keep at it!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.460
So what is it, huh?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.420
Do you wanna die, or do you wanna be killed?

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.080
Both!

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:04.630
I want to fight the world and get killed by someone,
anyone, out there.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.080
Otherwise, I'm gonna destroy the whole world myself!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.080
Liar.

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:14.330
You didn't need to join the army to do that.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:16.790
You could've just started your endless fight.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:20.750
Instead, you came over here and
got all passionate about helping people,

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.630
teaching them how to work more efficiently and crap!

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.250
You were thinking ahead.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:30.380
Thinking about the people who would survive.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:34.210
You wouldn't care about that
if you really wanted to destroy the world!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.460
Shut up, Mernes.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:46.380
You don't hate the world.
You don't want to kill the humans, either.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:50.710
I know what you're really after!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.460
Mernes...

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:03.380
A below-freezing auto-counter?! How powerful is he?!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.040
That makes three.

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.210
What I'm really after, huh?!

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.790
I told you what I'm really after!

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:17.420
I want to save the world, even if I have to destroy it!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.130
You're finally ready to fight me, huh, Lily?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.960
I don't wanna fight. I don't wanna!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.250
I don't wanna have to do this.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.130
But Leo...

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:38.330
You don't look like you're having any fun!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.580
You're smiling, but you're not happy at all!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:46.920
So I'll help... I'll stop you!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:52.630
Because I love you, Leo... I love you a whole lot!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:56.580
So I'll help you by stopping you!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.250
Lily...

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.420
Fine, then. Do it.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:22.830
Right then, I realized the truth once more.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.880
Leo was neither human nor demon.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:31.380
He was a monster, created by ancient humans.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.130
We can't win like this.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:38.080
He'll kill us, then humanity,

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.170
then the Demon World, then the future...

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.540
I've no time left to falter.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:52.330
Shutina, I'm using it. Buy me 42 seconds of time.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:58.080
Honestly, my Queen? 42 seconds against Leo?

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:03.250
I have no one else to turn to. If you cannot,
that's the end of everything.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:08.460
Oh, I'll do it, of course. Why wouldn't I?

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:12.960
It's just one more impossible demand
you've foisted upon me, like every other!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:17.750
I'm sorry. If we make it back alive,
I'll treat you to the finest wine.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:22.830
This may be my one and only chance.

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:28.380
But if I'm correct about Leo's true objective,

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.670
then I might be able to win. I might be able to kill him.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:35.830
A spell?

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:41.920
Yes. Now that I am abdicating
my throne to you, I must pass it on.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.460
What, just because I'm your daughter?

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.080
Please, that doesn't mean--

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:49.670
No, never mind. Forget I said anything.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.710
Cease your prattling, former Demon King Cychreus.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.790
I need not your assistance, nor any secret royal magic.

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:59.130
I don't want to have to pass it down,
either, but I don't have a choice.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:03.750
This spell has been passed down from
Demon King to Demon King for centuries.

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:04.580
Centuries?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.210
You know of the Hero, yes?

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:12.000
Of course. The Hero that defeated
so many of our brethren long ago.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:16.920
Astarot devised a spell to assist in battle against him,

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:19.960
one designed solely for defeating the Hero.

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:21.580
Solely for defeating him?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:26.580
The spell is highly limited in its uses
and is extremly costly to cast.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.790
I know not of any Demon King who has yet to use it.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:33.880
To be completely honest, the spell itself
is no more than a gamble.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.710
Then I may never use it.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:43.380
I needn't rely on such a gamble, nor fear him.
The full extent of my power will be enough.

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:49.630
I thought you'd say that. Maybe you'll be all right, then.

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:50.790
Of course I will.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:56.080
Neph salem arcranus elgil hel...

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:56.920
Leo!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:03.380
I've known for too long that you are a terrible liar!

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:07.710
You could've killed Edvard,
but you just sent him flying!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.630
You interrupted Mernes before
he could finish his sentence!

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.710
You even hesitated when Lily offered to help!

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.830
You don't want to destroy the world.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:22.500
The only thing you hate,
the only thing you want to destroy,

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.790
is yourself!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.710
You're afraid of your future.

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:33.380
A future where you want to save the world,
but can't, where your life has no meaning.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:38.580
You're afraid that you might actually destroy
the world in an attempt to save it!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.580
I'm right, aren't I?!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:54.710
So you've forced yourself to play the villain,

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:58.960
all in a bid to get us to defeat you
while you're still sane and in control.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:02.540
After ensuring your Philosopher's Stone
and your work is passed on

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:06.460
and knowing that humans and demons
will ally with one another when you're gone!

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:09.830
You fool!

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:14.670
Six chains, twelve swords to avenge the world!

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.670
I'm almost there! Don't die on me, Shutina!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.040
Don't you dare die!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:19.580
Is that the best you could do
after three thousand years of life?

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:23.710
Leo,

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:26.330
you're...

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:35.170
Enough already. Die.

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:41.790
It's YOU who will die here!

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:43.630
Listen well.

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:50.580
This spell will use all of your mana to disable
the Hero's abilities for a brief moment.

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.080
We call it...

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.830
Hero binding spell:

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:55.250
Anti-Leo!

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:40.290
<b>Next Time:</b>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:40.290
<b>What Makes</b>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:40.290
<b>a Hero</b>
